#~ msgid "Editing"
#~ msgstr "編集"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "In the notebook widget the loop "
#~ "runs both ways. Clicking an element "
#~ "opens a properties panel where its "
#~ "position, orientation, size, curvature, "
#~ "refractive index, reflectivities and tracing"
#~ " flags can be edited. Elements and"
#~ " sources can be added, removed and"
